      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Preparing for the introduction \nof HPV vaccines: policy and \nprogramme guidance for countries\nPreparing for the introduction of HPV vaccines:  policy and programme guidance for countries\n© World Health Organization 2006\nAll rights reserved. Publications of the World Health Organization can be obtained from WHO Press, World Health\nOrganization, 20 Avenue Appia, 1211 Geneva 27, Switzerland (tel.: +41 22 791 3264; fax: +41 22 791 4857; e-mail:\nbookorders@who.int). Requests for permission to reproduce or translate WHO publications – whether for sale or for\nnoncommercial distribution – should be ad",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The front matter of WHO's 2006 guidance 'Preparing for the introduction of HPV vaccines: policy and programme guidance for countries', with copyright, disclaimers and a contents list. It notes that the content draws on a March 2006 technical consultation in Montreux on sexual and reproductive health programmes and HPV vaccines and lists the participating experts. The acknowledgements name the UNFPA and WHO departments involved and say the note aims to alert stakeholders in several health programmes to key issues.",
        "state": "draft",
